# Scheduler Prototype → Usable → Robust
## Phase 0: Prototype (DONE)
- [x] Implements IScheduler with priority queue & async workers
- [x] Handles task lifecycle (PENDING→RUNNING→COMPLETED/FAILED)
- [x] Error logging and stats collection

## Phase 1: Usable
- [x] Support input-level batching: submit_batch(plugin, inputs)
- [x] Add task cancellation for RUNNING tasks (via plugin cooperative timeout)
- [x] Integrate with Monitor for vulnerability recording

## Phase 2: Robust
- [ ] Distributed scheduling support (e.g., via Redis queue)
- [ ] Resource-aware scheduling (CPU/memory limits)
- [ ] Task dependency graph (e.g., Parser → Checker → Verifier chain)